Fireworks Mortar Racks &amp; Fusing: A Developer’s Guide
Khi develop fireworks simulation/game, việc hiểu rõ cơ chế thực tế của mortar racks và fusing systems là cực kỳ quan trọng. Bài này mình sẽ breakdown từ góc nhìn technical để implement vào code.

Source: Phân tích từ Skylighter’s Mortar Rack &amp; Fusing Guide


🎯 Core Concepts
Mortar (Ống phóng)
Tube chứa shell, có đáy bịt kín. Materials:

HDPE Plastic - phổ biến, rẻ
Fiberglass - bền hơn, đắt hơn
Paper - disposable
Metal - special cases only

Mortar Rack (Giá đỡ)
Structure giữ mortars ở vị trí cố định, có 2 kiểu:

Perpendicular - thẳng đứng 90°
Fan/Angled - nghiêng (tạo góc bắn)


🔧 Technical Specs cho 3D Modeling
Mortar Dimensions
interface MortarTube {
  innerDiameter: number;    // 1.8&quot; cho festival balls
  length: number;           // typically 10-12 inches
  wallThickness: number;    // 0.1-0.2&quot; cho fiberglass
  material: &#039;HDPE&#039; | &#039;Fiberglass&#039; | &#039;Paper&#039; | &#039;Metal&#039;;
  burialDepth?: number;     // 2/3 length nếu chôn đất
}
Rack Structure
interface MortarRack {
  mortarCount: number;
  spacing: number;          // ~3 inches center-to-center
  angle: number;            // 90° (perpendicular) hoặc 45-75° (fan)
  orientation: &#039;perpendicular&#039; | &#039;fan&#039;;
  anchoring: &#039;buried&#039; | &#039;rebar&#039; | &#039;feet&#039;;
}
Safety constraint:
// Rack ends phải VUÔNG GÓC với crowd
// Nếu rack đổ, không bắn về phía đám đông
rackOrientation.perpendicular = true; // to crowd front

🔥 Fusing System: The Brain of the Show
Đây là phần hay nhất - timing và sequencing logic!
Fuse Types &amp; Burn Rates
enum FuseType {
  AMERICAN_VISCO = &#039;american_visco&#039;,
  CHINESE_VISCO = &#039;chinese_visco&#039;,
  FAST_VISCO = &#039;fast_visco&#039;,
  FAST_FUSE = &#039;fast_fuse&#039;,
  TIME_FUSE = &#039;time_fuse&#039;,
  QUICKMATCH = &#039;quickmatch&#039;,
}

const BURN_RATES: Record&lt;FuseType, number&gt; = {
  [FuseType.AMERICAN_VISCO]: 2.5,    // seconds per inch
  [FuseType.CHINESE_VISCO]: 1.7,
  [FuseType.FAST_VISCO]: 0.25,
  [FuseType.FAST_FUSE]: 0.125,       // 0.1-0.15 avg
  [FuseType.TIME_FUSE]: 2.6,         // 2.2-3.0 avg
  [FuseType.QUICKMATCH]: 0.0,        // instantaneous
};
Pro tip: Trong thực tế, mỗi cuộn fuse có variance. Best practice:
function calibrateFuse(fuseType: FuseType): number {
  // Cut 10 inches, time với stopwatch
  // Return actual burn rate for that roll
  const measuredTime = measureBurnTime(10); // inches
  return measuredTime / 10;
}

🎬 Firing Modes
1. Manual Hand Firing
Simplest mode - user clicks to fire mỗi shell.
class ManualFiringMode {
  shells: Shell[];

  fireNext() {
    const shell = this.shells.shift();
    if (!shell) return;

    // Shell leader burn time
    const fuseDelay = shell.fuseLength * BURN_RATES[FuseType.FAST_VISCO];

    setTimeout(() =&gt; {
      shell.launch();
    }, fuseDelay * 1000);

    // Shell flight time ~3-4s
    setTimeout(() =&gt; {
      shell.burst();
    }, (fuseDelay + 3.5) * 1000);
  }
}
UX consideration:
Nếu user fire ngay sau khi shell launch → rhythm tự nhiên ~3-4s giữa các burst.

2. Fast Chain (Finale Mode)
Tất cả shells bắn đồng loạt - dùng cho finale.
class FastChainMode {
  shells: Shell[];
  quickmatchLength: number;

  fire() {
    // Quickmatch burns instantly
    // All shell leaders ignite simultaneously

    this.shells.forEach((shell, index) =&gt; {
      const fuseDelay = shell.fuseLength * BURN_RATES[FuseType.FAST_VISCO];

      // Slight variance trong practice (0.1-0.3s)
      const variance = Math.random() * 0.2;

      setTimeout(() =&gt; {
        shell.launch();
      }, (fuseDelay + variance) * 1000);
    });
  }
}
Visual implementation:
// Trong 3D scene
const quickmatchChain = new Line3D({
  color: 0xff0000,  // red quickmatch
  points: shells.map(s =&gt; s.position),
});

// Animation spark chạy dọc chain
animateSpark(quickmatchChain, {
  speed: Infinity,  // instantaneous
});

3. Delayed Chain (Choreographed Sequence)
Timing chính xác giữa các shells - đây là core của fireworks show programming!
Method A: Visco Chain
class ViscoChainMode {
  shells: Shell[];
  fuseType: FuseType.CHINESE_VISCO; // or AMERICAN_VISCO
  spacing: number = 3; // inches between mortars

  calculateDelay(): number {
    // 3 inches spacing
    // Chinese Visco = 1.7s/inch
    return this.spacing * BURN_RATES[this.fuseType];
    // = 3 * 1.7 = 5.1 seconds delay
  }

  fire() {
    const delay = this.calculateDelay();

    this.shells.forEach((shell, index) =&gt; {
      setTimeout(() =&gt; {
        const fuseDelay = shell.fuseLength * BURN_RATES[FuseType.FAST_VISCO];

        setTimeout(() =&gt; {
          shell.launch();
        }, fuseDelay * 1000);

      }, index * delay * 1000);
    });
  }
}
Method B: Time Fuse + Buckets (Precision Timing)
Đây là advanced technique - dùng time fuse pieces với chính xác cao.
interface TimeFuseSegment {
  length: number;           // inches
  burnRate: number;         // seconds per inch
  crossMatchLength: number; // 0.5 inches each end
  buckets: Bucket[];        // 2 paper buckets
}

class TimeFuseChainMode {
  shells: Shell[];
  desiredDelay: number;     // seconds

  createSegment(): TimeFuseSegment {
    const TIME_FUSE_RATE = 2.2; // s/inch
    const CROSS_MATCH = 0.5;    // inches each end

    // Calculate fuse length needed
    const fuseLength = this.desiredDelay / TIME_FUSE_RATE;
    const totalLength = fuseLength + (CROSS_MATCH * 2);

    return {
      length: fuseLength,
      burnRate: TIME_FUSE_RATE,
      crossMatchLength: CROSS_MATCH,
      buckets: [new Bucket(), new Bucket()],
    };
  }

  fire() {
    let cumulativeDelay = 0;

    this.shells.forEach((shell, index) =&gt; {
      if (index === 0) {
        // First shell: no delay
        shell.launch();
      } else {
        // Subsequent shells: time fuse delay
        const segment = this.createSegment();
        const actualDelay = segment.length * segment.burnRate;
        cumulativeDelay += actualDelay;

        setTimeout(() =&gt; {
          shell.launch();
        }, cumulativeDelay * 1000);
      }
    });
  }
}
Bucket visualization trong 3D:
class Bucket extends Object3D {
  // Kraft paper cylinder, 0.5&quot; diameter
  diameter: number = 0.5;
  height: number = 1.5;

  render() {
    const geometry = new CylinderGeometry(
      this.diameter / 2,
      this.diameter / 2,
      this.height,
      8 // segments
    );

    const material = new MeshStandardMaterial({
      color: 0xd2b48c,  // kraft paper color
      roughness: 0.8,
    });

    this.mesh = new Mesh(geometry, material);
  }
}

🎮 Implementing Show Sequencer
Đây là class tổng hợp để control toàn bộ show:
class FireworksShowSequencer {
  racks: MortarRack[];
  sequences: FiringSequence[];
  masterIgnition: IgnitionPoint;

  constructor() {
    this.sequences = [];
  }

  addSequence(config: SequenceConfig) {
    const sequence = new FiringSequence(config);
    this.sequences.push(sequence);
  }

  // Build show từ 1 điểm đốt duy nhất
  buildChain() {
    let currentTime = 0;

    this.sequences.forEach((seq, index) =&gt; {
      if (index === 0) {
        // First sequence ignites immediately
        seq.ignitionTime = 0;
      } else {
        // Calculate delay from previous sequence
        const prevSeq = this.sequences[index - 1];
        const delay = this.calculateDelay(prevSeq, seq);
        currentTime += delay;
        seq.ignitionTime = currentTime;
      }
    });
  }

  calculateDelay(from: FiringSequence, to: FiringSequence): number {
    // Logic tính delay dựa trên:
    // - Burn time của sequence trước
    // - Overlap time desired
    // - Time fuse delay elements

    const fromDuration = from.totalBurnTime();
    const overlapTime = to.config.overlapSeconds || 0;

    return fromDuration - overlapTime;
  }

  play() {
    // Light master fuse
    this.masterIgnition.ignite();

    // Schedule all sequences
    this.sequences.forEach(seq =&gt; {
      setTimeout(() =&gt; {
        seq.fire();
      }, seq.ignitionTime * 1000);
    });
  }
}
Example usage:
const show = new FireworksShowSequencer();

// Sequence 1: Opening salvo (6 shells, fast chain)
show.addSequence({
  type: &#039;fast_chain&#039;,
  shells: 6,
  rack: rack1,
});

// Sequence 2: Mid show (5 shells, 3.3s delay each)
show.addSequence({
  type: &#039;delayed_chain&#039;,
  shells: 5,
  rack: rack2,
  delaySeconds: 3.3,
  fuseType: FuseType.TIME_FUSE,
});

// Sequence 3: Finale (12 shells, all at once)
show.addSequence({
  type: &#039;fast_chain&#039;,
  shells: 12,
  rack: rack3,
  overlapSeconds: 5, // start 5s before seq2 ends
});

show.buildChain();
show.play();

🎨 3D Visualization Considerations
Fuse Rendering
class FuseRenderer {
  renderQuickmatch(points: Vector3[]) {
    // Red paper tube, black powder inside
    const curve = new CatmullRomCurve3(points);
    const geometry = new TubeGeometry(curve, 64, 0.15, 8);

    const material = new MeshStandardMaterial({
      color: 0xcc0000,  // red
      roughness: 0.6,
    });

    return new Mesh(geometry, material);
  }

  animateBurn(fuse: Mesh, burnRate: number) {
    // Particle system cho spark chạy dọc fuse
    const sparkEmitter = new ParticleEmitter({
      rate: 100,
      color: 0xffaa00,
      size: 0.05,
      velocity: new Vector3(0, 0.1, 0),
    });

    // Move spark along fuse curve
    const totalLength = fuse.geometry.parameters.length;
    const duration = totalLength * burnRate * 1000; // ms

    gsap.to(sparkEmitter.position, {
      duration: duration / 1000,
      ease: &#039;none&#039;,
      motionPath: {
        path: fuse.geometry.parameters.path,
        align: fuse.geometry.parameters.path,
      },
    });
  }
}
Bucket Physics
Buckets cần realistic “wiggle” khi fuse burn:
class BucketPhysics {
  bucket: Bucket;

  simulateBurn() {
    // Slight shake khi flame hit bucket
    gsap.to(this.bucket.rotation, {
      x: Math.random() * 0.1 - 0.05,
      y: Math.random() * 0.1 - 0.05,
      duration: 0.1,
      yoyo: true,
      repeat: 3,
    });

    // Small particle burst khi flame exit
    this.emitSparks();
  }
}

⚠️ Safety Considerations for Realistic Simulation
Nếu làm educational/realistic sim, cần implement safety rules:
const SAFETY_RULES = {
  // Rack orientation
  rackEndPerpendicularToCrowd: true,

  // Minimum distances (feet)
  spectatorDistance: 70,      // cho 1.75&quot; shells
  falloutRadius: 100,

  // Mortar stability
  minimumKickResistance: true, // rack phải chịu được đá

  // Fusing
  noStapleGunNearFuse: true,  // CRITICAL - có người chết vì vi phạm
  testBurnRate: true,          // always test trước khi fuse show

  // Shell seating
  shellFullySeated: true,      // shell phải đáy ống, tránh low break
};
Low break simulation:
class Shell {
  launch() {
    if (!this.isFullySeated) {
      // Shell không ngồi đúng đáy
      // → lift charge yếu hơn
      // → burst thấp hơn dự kiến
      this.burstAltitude *= 0.5; // 50% height
      this.triggerSafetyWarning(&#039;LOW BREAK - Fire hazard!&#039;);
    }
  }
}

📊 Data Structures for Show Files
Để save/load fireworks shows, cần format chuẩn:
interface ShowFile {
  version: string;
  metadata: {
    title: string;
    author: string;
    duration: number;
    musicFile?: string;
  };

  layout: {
    racks: RackDefinition[];
    devices: DeviceDefinition[];
  };

  sequences: SequenceDefinition[];

  // Master timeline
  timeline: {
    ignitionPoint: Vector3;
    sequences: TimelineEntry[];
  };
}

interface TimelineEntry {
  sequenceId: string;
  startTime: number;        // seconds from show start
  fuseConnection: {
    from: string;           // device/sequence ID
    to: string;
    fuseType: FuseType;
    length: number;         // inches
    delaySeconds: number;   // calculated
  };
}
